Consider:
- Exact name matches (highest priority)
- Similar names with different formatting
- Abbreviations vs. full names (e.g., "SW" vs "Stadtwerke")
- Legal form variations (e.g., "GmbH" vs "mbH" vs missing)
- Regional context (city/location information)
